{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49014","headline":"秋日江东晚行 · 姚揆","name":"秋日江东晚行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢迢驱马过江东，此际令人恨莫穷。\n一撮秋烟堤上白，半轮残日岭头红。\n路岐滋味犹如旧，乡曲声音渐不同。\n含思看看到梁苑，画楼丝竹彻遥空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚揆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}